Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=24}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.62,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,好大一隻獅子狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:48.30,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,是誰家的啊？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:52.50,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們要怎麼找到阿玉那孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:56.42,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,就算開口問，\N鎮民也不會告訴我們。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:00.53,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,他們全都在大蛇的掌控之下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.23,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,但有些人看起來像\N普通人，不是打手。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:10.22,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,這裡向來都有普通的村民。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.91,0:02:16.23,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,直到二十年前，\N這裡還是座繁榮的城下町。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:21.82,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,但有一天，大蛇的手下來了，\N奪走了他們看中的房子。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.79,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,然後，除了必要的商人之外……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:30.84,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,其他人全被趕出了城鎮。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:36.26,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,這就是博羅鎮的由來。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.78,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,一個相撲力士？他是怎麼……？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:08.20,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,鎮子深處出事了。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.67,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,既然有個相撲力士飛了出來……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.33,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我猜是在比相撲吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:23.80,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(960,225.6)\i1}再問一次，難道就沒有人\N能夠打倒……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:30.13,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(960,225.6)\i1}花都的橫綱，浦島嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.76,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,又是一群弱雞。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:49.70,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,還有更多人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:02.26,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,相撲啊？聽起來很好玩！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:14.81,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}浦島至今已經打敗了\N十九名力士。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:20.15,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}但要說到打斷的骨頭數量，\N至今已經有……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.85,Main-207+,Yokan,0,0,0,,十根手臂骨……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.85,0:04:26.10,Main-207+,Yokan,0,0,0,,十五根腿骨……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:28.37,Main-207+,Yokan,0,0,0,,五十二根肋骨……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:30.83,Main-207+,Yokan,0,0,0,,四顆頭蓋骨，還有……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.61,Main-207+,Yokan,0,0,0,,七根脊椎骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:39.50,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}總共八十八根骨頭，\N還有四名力士下落不明！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.92,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}壓倒性的實力！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:47.14,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}他的力量超乎常人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.50,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}不敗的怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:55.90,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}橫綱浦島！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.90,0:04:59.98,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,今天我們要來場特別的表演賽！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.07,0:05:03.49,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,打倒浦島的人，\N就能帶走驚人的五百枚金幣！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:06.11,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,打倒浦島！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.91,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,我賭你贏！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.32,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,你們做得到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:15.12,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,我們有完美的計畫！\N我們會贏得獎金！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.65,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,打敗那些混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:19.54,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,浦島大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:29.14,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦！看看這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:35.18,Main-207+,Gyoji,0,0,0,,預備……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:38.40,Main-207+,Gyoji,0,0,0,,開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:50.49,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:56.33,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我就知道你會來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:02.04,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,這代表你決定\N要當我老婆了，對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:06.96,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,失禮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.30,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你可躲不到我背後。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.12,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:16.81,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}這女人跟浦島訂婚了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:22.77,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}真幸運！她被一名橫綱愛上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:28.67,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}這可是天大的醜聞啊！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:32.39,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,什麼？！偉大的浦島有老婆了？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:33.69,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,他老婆？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:34.79,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,不……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:42.75,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,正如你剛才所見，他自認\N我會嫁給他。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:50.02,Flashbacks-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊！我等等在博羅鎮有場比賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:54.01,Flashbacks-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,如果你有興趣，\N就來看看我有多強吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:02.48,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我和他的想法並不一致。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:06.36,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.49,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:12.45,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們在找人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.16,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,是個叫阿玉的小女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.87,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,告訴我這鎮上的老大在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:21.01,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,她應該在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:27.34,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,那女人真讓人火大！\N可惡的拜金女……！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:31.83,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,她塊頭很大，但這樣正好配浦島！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.30,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,我才跟她更配！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.01,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們根本沒在聽……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:42.48,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊來看我了。夥計們，把她帶來給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.65,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,－是，老大！\N－是，老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:46.94,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,大哥！我都不知道你這麼會把妹！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:50.24,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,大家都想跟你一樣！\N難怪她會愛上你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.36,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:57.28,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好了，我們自己\N去找她吧！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:03.96,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,喂，小姐！浦島大哥\N要見你！跟我們走！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:06.46,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,別擋路，混蛋！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.25,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,揍扁他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,別擋我們的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.40,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:34.74,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,好一記衝撞！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我看致勝招式\N是正面推撞吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.52,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,跟我走，小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:49.38,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,不……請住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:57.14,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,你真的要砍\N一個手無寸鐵的裸男嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.81,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,呀呼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:12.61,Main-207+,Atagoyama+Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,嘿咻！嘿咻！嘿咻！嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:16.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,別擋路！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:31.34,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，索隆！你為什麼\N放他們把她帶走？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:37.72,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,抱歉……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:41.14,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我覺得那樣不對……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.68,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,去砍一個裸男。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.82,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,再說……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:50.19,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,她可不只是個茶館的女侍。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:56.57,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,喂！她不是另一個鎮上\N茶館的姑娘嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:10:01.24,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,以她的身分，竟敢\N踏進這個鎮，真是放肆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:05.45,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,是嗎？！那我們就得把她趕出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.67,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,她是個下賤的女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:13.50,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,閉嘴，你們這些平民！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:23.46,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,對我們武士來說，你們這些蠢貨\N全都是一樣下賤的二等賤民！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:29.10,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你們的命一文不值！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:31.94,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你們的生死……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.40,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,全由我一句話決定！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:11:01.85,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,那麼，阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.64,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你何不……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.76,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,做……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:09.64,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我的女人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:18.37,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,奴家可不認得\N有哪個人民……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:20.65,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,是二等的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.21,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,少開玩笑了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:56.44,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,這裡唯一下賤的，是你的心。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:09.41,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,橫綱的髮髻！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:18.26,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,太帥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.42,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿菊真有膽識！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:24.33,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,現在越來越精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:28.93,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,他被那女人拒絕了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.89,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,髮髻還被砍斷了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:34.52,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這下應該能快點\N把他們老大引出來。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:55.17,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:58.00,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:00.96,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,背叛了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.59,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,你竟敢這樣對我……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:07.89,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,還當著這麼多人的面？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:14.25,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,他看起來像尊憤怒的神明！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.86,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:24.19,Main-207+,Atagoyama,0,0,0,,糟了！那個架式是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:27.07,Main-207+,Sumo Wrestler,0,0,0,,……能把對手打飛的\N超凡張手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.66,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,請饒了我吧，浦島大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.00,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,不過……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:46.01,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,看來你果然是個\N會對女人動手的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:53.93,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:17.29,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:19.71,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}相撲張手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:54.24,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,哇－哇－哇……糟糟糟……！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:56.63,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不、不、不！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:58.54,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,糟了，糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:17.68,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:21.73,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你對我的張手做了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:28.19,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,可惡……你是阿菊的什麼人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:32.32,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,別擋我的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:36.70,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我非得把阿菊撕成碎片……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:40.00,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,不然我會顏面盡失！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:42.79,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好啊！沒問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.85,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那就是……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.68,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dosukoi{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.05,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dosukoi{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:56.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,只要你能打贏我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:00.06,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.90,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,很擅長相撲！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.20,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,給我……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:14.41,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.58,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}菩薩張手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:34.01,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,他在閃躲浦島的張手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.76,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,他好敏捷！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.43,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,認真點，小鬼！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:41.02,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,光靠閃躲是贏不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.48,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}碎耳掌！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:57.24,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.28,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}挖眼指！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:08.38,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！那些全是犯規招式！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:10.56,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.55,0:17:13.67,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:18.80,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,一名橫綱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.80,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,唉，隨便啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:31.23,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,赫戴姆老大！出事了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:36.15,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,啊？橫綱的髮髻\N被一個女人砍斷了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:40.70,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,大家都很不滿！\N我們不知道該怎麼辦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:44.87,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,我才不管！你要我怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:56.72,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,我正忙著撕她的臉頰呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:03.35,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,別煩我！你們的\N狒狒還你們就是了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.23,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,請住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.71,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,想都別想！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:15.88,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,聽說你提到了「光月」這個名字。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:24.70,Flashbacks-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,等光月家回來，\N他們會給你們好看！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:28.65,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你應該很清楚……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:33.27,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,說出「光月」這個名字……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:35.42,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,可是重罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:40.72,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,所以這也算是對你的懲罰。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:46.28,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你早就該別再追逐逝去的幻影了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:49.36,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,光月家是個邪惡的家族……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:57.17,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,二十年前妄想毀掉和之國！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.17,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,讓開，臭小子！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:24.72,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊闖的禍是無法彌補的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:31.74,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,她拒絕了嫁給我、\N侍奉我這名武士的殊榮……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.10,0:19:34.90,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,還玷污了我的名聲！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:40.08,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我要打爆她的腦袋以儆效尤！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:56.25,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,給我閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:58.67,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我說了，等你打贏我再隨便你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.94,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不過你是贏不了我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:18.65,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你什麼意思？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.82,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.45,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:31.54,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,和之國最強的橫綱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:35.79,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,050)}超凡張手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:54.40,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.35,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,不知道。會是什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:13.25,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你或許是橫綱……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:17.25,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,但我可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:25.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,將要成為海賊王的男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.56,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,痛痛痛痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:36.23,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,魯夫大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:39.32,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.30,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨人……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:08.97,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}相撲張手！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:32.45,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dosukoi{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.43,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,不……！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:57.77,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,搞什麼……？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:40.51,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我－我現在安全了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:55.96,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}橫－橫綱……{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:59.99,Main-207+,Ikkaku,0,0,0,,{\i1}被打飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:02.79,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,橫綱！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.79,0:24:06.75,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,不可能！他怎麼會輸給\N那樣一個小個子！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.36,0:24:19.31,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那{\i1}我{\i0}就是橫綱了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.31,0:24:23.81,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我不管你是誰，\N放馬過來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:30.03,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我想我們鬧得夠大，\N足以引起他們老大的注意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:32.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我也這麼覺得！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:35.03,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,那－那傢伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.56,0:24:38.99,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,我想起來了！他就是那個殺了奉行的人……！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:43.92,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,索隆十郎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:53.93,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那又怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.12,0:25:03.33,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,別告訴我他是那傢伙的同夥！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:08.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.91,0:25:12.44,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,把這鎮上的老大帶來！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.38,0:25:38.72,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們是來把阿玉帶回去的！
